  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "307期封面作品名稱：乾杯"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjRNzNxZbdPx2xflGNW1t4pEvi6bVBhyerL_RMr6t2xwCkD215cANz3lQDdaysOez4RYoVDt8ROWkDZ4w66bclygZzcXfF7v9g4tWH_UcOSO1W5jN7CZA-Xf0_KAYU96c15LH8zkuqBxmBW/s1600/%25E4%25B9%25BE%25E6%259D%25AF.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1132\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"452\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjRNzNxZbdPx2xflGNW1t4pEvi6bVBhyerL_RMr6t2xwCkD215cANz3lQDdaysOez4RYoVDt8ROWkDZ4w66bclygZzcXfF7v9g4tWH_UcOSO1W5jN7CZA-Xf0_KAYU96c15LH8zkuqBxmBW/s640/%25E4%25B9%25BE%25E6%259D%25AF.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<b><br /></b>\n<b><br /></b>\n<b>作品名稱</b><br />\n<br />\n乾杯<br />\n<br />\n<b>作品簡介</b><br />\n<br />\n夜婆tiānn-tiānn睏bē去，伊ê tsiok濟朋友lóng kā伊tàu-sann-kāng解決tsit个問題。夜婆看著錢鼠細膩、大頭藍龍、艱苦ngiau牛、白鼻毛猫kap海翁，逐个朋友lóng tī伊身軀邊陪伴--伊，感覺tsiok歡喜、tsiok幸福--ê！<br />\n<br />\n《夜婆失眠》是一个beh來kā大大細細教台羅所寫ê故事，希望透過趣味ê內容，hōo逐家認bat台文讀寫。<br />\n<br />\n<b>創作方式</b><br />\n<br />\n電腦繪圖<br />\n<br />\n<b>年代</b><br />\n<br />\n2019<br />\n<br />\n<b>作者簡介</b><br />\n<br />\n林小杯，繪本創作者，「基進會輾轉台語讀寫班」結業學員。<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCLsx6swDWjxjDd8omaE_1hDFEoWh_i0-XXtqnyDUNYgGvQSiVfUMdg1xpEImU9PbiuUeoQ0Kcb7KxWcdVY-YgamLPO3oXQnvzq5qBGvbW2zZj16LZA9eAwlxBip9KEBGU9fqnS3_jMjYX/s1600/307%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCLsx6swDWjxjDd8omaE_1hDFEoWh_i0-XXtqnyDUNYgGvQSiVfUMdg1xpEImU9PbiuUeoQ0Kcb7KxWcdVY-YgamLPO3oXQnvzq5qBGvbW2zZj16LZA9eAwlxBip9KEBGU9fqnS3_jMjYX/s320/307%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"225\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<br />"
